{
  "job_B1.8.4.4_20251001_193259": {
    "chunk_text": ", & he getacnode urne H\u00e6lend Crist, \u00fee us sibbe brohte, & Nu standa\u00f0 manega cyningas on \u00fe\u00e6ra Cininga Bocum, be \u00feam ic gesette eac sume boc on Englisc. Sume hig w\u00e6ron rihtwise & wur\u00feodon a God, swa swa Ezechias w\u00e6s & si\u00fe\u00fean Iosias, & eac sume Sume w\u00e6ron arlease & swi\u00f0e yfele ferdon, \u00feonne hi Godes ne gimdon, ne God him ne fylste; & Nabochodonosor, se namcu\u00f0a cining on Chaldeiscum earde, com to Hierusalem mid micelre fyrde, & Se Chaldea cininc com \u00fea to his earde mid \u00fe\u00e6re hu\u00f0e & \u00fe\u00e6re herelafe, on \u00f0\u00e6re w\u00e6s Daniel, se \u00d0as \u00feri cnihtas het se cyning awurpan in to byrnendum ofne; ac heora bendas sona wurdon & se kining hi het \u00fea gan of \u00feam ofne. Her ongan seo fifte yld \u00feissere worulde; seo stod swa astreht o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Crist sylf com on \u00fe\u00e6re sixtan Seo herelaf \u00f0a wunode \u00fe\u00e6s gehergodan folces on Chaldeiscum earde under \u00feam kininge, gecn\u00e6we Hundseofontig geara hi wunodon \u00fe\u00e6r on \u00feeowte, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Cirus cyning hi asende eft ongean to Iudea Nu sindon twa m\u00e6re bec gesette on endebyrdnysse to Salomones bocum, swilce he hig gedihte; for Ecclesiasticus, swi\u00f0e micele bec, & man hig r\u00e6t on circan to micclum wisdome swi\u00f0e gewunelice. We nyma\u00f0 \u00fea witegan nu \u00fee witegodon embe Crist \u00feurh \u00feone Halgan Gast be \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes to",
